// Outturn (plan basis) by financial year, Spending Review group and plan measure equals dw.outturn_plan_basis_inyear
// at the closing release of the year (the running sum of the year's deltas, which is what the model's Outturn is
// with no release selected), for the seven plan measures that table defines. The cells are those that have a plan row
// and a basis other than zero (the table keeps no zero rows; the model returns 0 for two cells whose lines net to zero).
EVALUATE
FILTER (
    SUMMARIZECOLUMNS (
        'Fiscal Year'[Financial Year],
        'Spending Review Group'[Spending Review Group],
        'Fact Plan'[Plan Measure],
        "basis", [Outturn (plan basis)]
    ),
    'Fact Plan'[Plan Measure] IN { "RDEL", "RDEL_EX_DEPN", "CDEL", "RAME", "CAME", "ADMIN", "ADMIN_EX_DEPN" }
        && [basis] <> 0
)
ORDER BY 'Fiscal Year'[Financial Year], 'Spending Review Group'[Spending Review Group], 'Fact Plan'[Plan Measure]
